# Vercel installs dependencies itself and builds the eve agents from source,
# so uploading these is pure round-trip cost — 18k files on the first attempt,
# past Vercel's 15k limit.
#
# Do NOT add `agents/` here: withEve builds each agent from its source at
# deploy time, and excluding it would produce a console with no runtime.
node_modules
**/node_modules

.next
.vercel
.eve
**/.eve
.output
.nitro

.git
.claude
.env*
*.log
